404d|n|One of numerous species and genera of rapacious birds of the family Falconidae. They differ from the true falcons in lacking the prominent tooth and notch of the bill, and in having shorter and less pointed wings. Many are of large size and grade into the eagles. Some, as the goshawk, were formerly trained like falcons. In a more general sense the word is not infrequently applied, also, to true falcons, as the sparrow hawk, pigeon hawk, duck hawk, and prairie hawk. ; An effort to force up phlegm from the throat, accompanied with noise. ; A small board, with a handle on the under side, to hold mortar.	a:508n,124,53;3ju7,118,5;6lrj,112,1;6ynn,92,2;9qdd,87,24;47au,77,6;8z8e,77,1;1urh,73,3;5ixj,73,1;5p1l,71,7;8dv3,68,4;1cro,67,4;2god,67,2;47o4,57,3;3rdn,55,82~3rdn,55,82;508n,124,53;9qdd,87,24;ys5,31,14;dnl,54,12;7t8z,23,8;5p1l,71,7;47au,77,6;zxf,26,6;3ju7,118,5;1cro,67,4;8dv3,68,4;6eqb,0,3;8az1,14,3;47o4,57,3	v:6ynn,92,2;3sxq,90,7;508n,90,5;8z8e,77,1;9drp,75,1;825t,50,3;8ds8,41,3;9tie,30,2;3rdn,25,10;ar2j,15,1;24nv,10,1;ys5,3,2~3rdn,25,10;3sxq,90,7;508n,90,5;825t,50,3;8ds8,41,3;ys5,3,2;6ynn,92,2;9tie,30,2;ar2j,15,1;9drp,75,1;24nv,10,1;8z8e,77,1	V:5cla,83,3;29uv,81,4;5z4l,74,1;6tey,53,1;8srn,53,3;7ocd,49,1;3cko,46,1;7f38,44,10;2hhl,36,5;3dbg,35,2;jj9,30,2;ag81,25,3;2qjy,24,1;7gis,16,16;1olc,16,8~7gis,16,16;7f38,44,10;1olc,16,8;2hhl,36,5;29uv,81,4;ag81,25,3;8srn,53,3;5cla,83,3;98jd,15,2;jj9,30,2;82lb,11,2;3dbg,35,2;5z4l,74,1;3cko,46,1;7ocd,49,1	n:2qnv,153,12;6lrj,140,7;qsq,123,12;9ejl,117,3;8z8e,116,15;5ixj,104,9;8wgy,99,7;9n0c,98,4;9qdd,98,49;508n,92,6;6ynn,82,1;89ag,79,23;2god,77,4;zre,66,25;ys5,65,152~ys5,65,152;9qdd,98,49;zre,66,25;89ag,79,23;8z8e,116,15;qsq,123,12;2qnv,153,12;3rdn,26,11;5ixj,104,9;149o,19,9;7t8z,23,8;8ds8,55,8;ag81,37,7;8wgy,99,7;5t4l,54,7	N:5z4l,114,16;41f0,111,27;8ct1,107,2;top,105,5;377s,93,8;9y95,90,3;29uv,84,5;41ez,83,11;42b3,76,19;43l0,75,13;35ra,69,4;5cla,67,1;y41,65,9;6tey,63,2;34uq,63,25~41f0,111,27;34uq,63,25;42b3,76,19;7f38,51,17;5z